;
; How Colonnade files its language index in MYRA (colonnade_rules.h CL5):
; a language's place in LANGUAGE_FIT.tsv (1..108) and the pillar its
; runtime column names (0 a Lingua language, 1 Sutra, 2 Trebago, 3 Eve,
; 4 KRON, 5 MYRA). The rules say which pairs hold; this says whether the
; values make a record.
^ZXCOLONNADE(lang:i3) = pillar:i1!
